      "key": "lede",
      "text": "{arm:brisk-s.few} delivers {measure.balanced_accuracy.brisk-s.few.mean}% Balanced accuracy at {measure.latency_ms.brisk-s.few.p95} p95 latency. Lowering the cell floor below {criteria.cell_floor.nano-xs.few.complex.news.value}% would allow the cheaper {arm:nano-xs.few}."
    },
    {
      "key": "decision.recommendation",
      "text": "Adopt {arm:brisk-s.few}: it satisfies all gates with {criteria.overall.brisk-s.few.value}% Balanced accuracy, clears all nine target cells, and costs {measure.cost_per_1m.brisk-s.few.mean} per million turns."
    },
    {
      "key": "decision.why_not",
      "text": "{arm:nano-xs.few} misses the cell floor on complex news turns; {arm:atlas-m.rubric} exceeds the latency budget; and {arm:brisk-s.zero} fails overall accuracy."
    },
    {
      "key": "decision.watch",
      "text": "The tightest margin is {weakest.arm}: {weakest.value}% against {weakest.criterion} at {weakest.threshold}%, a clearance of {weakest.margin} points. Calibration on complex news remains unmeasured."
    },
    {
      "key": "decision.next",
      "text": "Test targeted few-shot examples for complex news on {arm:nano-xs.few} to evaluate whether its {criteria.cell_floor.nano-xs.few.complex.news.value}% accuracy can clear the floor."
